# Design System

Full detail: `docs/design/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`. Skill: `emil-design-eng` (do not change palette/architecture).

## Approved palette

```text
background: #FFFFFF
foreground: #010101
accent: #F8BC03
secondary: #1F4E79
surface-muted: #F6F6F4
border: #E7E7E3
text-muted: #6B6B67
surface-dark: #2A2A28
```

## Color rules

- White background; near-black text; yellow primary accent; navy secondary.
- Yellow text on white is forbidden; dark text on yellow.
- No new brand colors without an ADR.
- Status colors need contrast and must not rely on color alone.

## Character

Clean, modern, high-contrast, functional, businesslike, calm. Not a generic admin dashboard. Avoid glass, heavy shadows, and decorative gradients.

## Tokens only

All values via tokens: colors, spacing, radii, typography, shadows, duration, easing, z-index, breakpoints. No scattered magic values.

## Animation

Allowed purposes only: feedback, spatial consistency, state indication, avoiding jarring change, explanation, rare delight.

- Prefer `transform` / `opacity`; never `transition: all`; no `ease-in` for UI entrance; no entrance from `scale(0)`.
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`; hover motion only with fine pointer hover.
- Do not add Motion for simple hover/fade. Springs only for gestures/momentum/interruptible interactions.
- Dense informational UIs: no decorative animation.
- After functional UI: analyze with `find-animation-opportunities`; plan with `improve-animations`; review changed motion with `review-animations`.
- DnD / sheets / physics: `apple-design` (behavior only, not Apple visuals).
